<title>THAILAND: Thai July foreign reserves fall slightly.</title>
<headline>Thai July foreign reserves fall slightly.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's foreign reserves rose fell slightly in July to US$39.4 billion from US$39.8 billion in June, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    THAI FOREIGN RESERVES   July 96    June 96     July 95</p>
<p>				     39.8	 39.8	  34.4</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 252-9950</p>
